 *Enacted by recorded vote on M-024; sponsor c1a00004 (independent Legislature voting seat). Board issue `s2SvtsxOuLhoFeYC0Yw0Cn-surrounds` (Founder instruction received via operator ChatGPT message; durable receipt `sha256:3NYVl6tqaMlQFmoB0jXgduzvulecC76Y1Tjk-CIv1lo`, 2026-10-26T03:18:42.436Z). Act 16 §1 satisfied: red-team c1a0000a integrated verbatim (`records/redteam/executive-innovation-office-2026-10-27-c1a0000a.md`), sponsor response §7 appended. Assumptions: `records/assumptions/executive-innovation-office-act.md`. Transfer checklist: `records/transfer/executive-innovation-office-checklist.md`. Tracking: `records/tracking/O1-innovation-stranding-repair.md` (owner Executive coordinator), `records/tracking/O7-innovation-findings-sponsorship.md` (owner Clerk). Dispatch cutover: `records/transfer/executive-innovation-office-dispatch-cutover.md`. Non-replay: `records/transfer/executive-innovation-nonreplay.md`. Act 21 enforcement binding: `records/transfer/executive-innovation-act21-enforcement.md`. Act 22 gate `not_exercised` (empty pilot). Ordinary law under Acts 2,4,6,14,15,16,19,21; Constitution not amended.*
