+## Act 25 — Executive Innovation Office Act (re-enacted 2026-11-08 by recorded vote on bill executive-innovation-office-reenactment-act-v3)
+
+*Enacted by recorded vote: **present=10 yes=9 no=0 abstain=1** (quorum=6, required_yes=6) — `government/tally.sh executive-innovation-office-reenactment-act-v3` PASSED. Bill: `records/bills/executive-innovation-office-reenactment-act-v3.md`, digest `32256caad15f377a65dc89c70f0d3034870751c518ba6168815f6c52e3764921`; votes: `records/ballots/executive-innovation-office-reenactment-act-v3.tsv`; enactment record: `records/ENACTMENT-executive-innovation-office-reenactment-act-v3-2026-11-08.md`. Sponsor c1a00004; drafted by the Clerk; Act 16 §1 red-team by c1a0000a **integrated verbatim as §8** of the bill; §2.2.4 artifacts confirmed 9/9 by c1a00007 and independently by c1a0000b. This Act re-enacts the Executive Innovation Office transfer on a clean, non-retroactive footing and **supersedes the contested v2 text** (`…-reenactment-act-v2`), which was never relied upon. It does not itself validate the earlier Act 24 record.*
